 to smart glasses, which audiences can also wear over prescription glasses. To reserve <span class=\"BoldText\">WatchWord Glasses</span>, please add to your order here.</h2><h2>Learn more about WatchWord on our <a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://www.oldmarkethall.co.uk/your-visit/access/\">Access</a> page</h2><h2>If you are using WatchWord for the first time, we ask that you arrive prior to the advertised start time to receive a user demonstration and guidance from our team.</h2>\r\n</div>","duration":0,"imageUrl":"","isOnSale":true,"name":"WatchWord Glasses","instanceDates":"3 July-31 October","thumbnailUrl":"","webUrl":"","webEventId":null,"id":"881508AKRBNVGQRQJJBQKBKBJBRHHDQSB","firstInstanceDateTime":"2026-07-03T14:30:00","firstInstanceDateTimeUtc":"2026-07-03T13:30:00Z","lastInstanceDateTime":"2026-10-31T12:00:00","lastInstanceDateTimeUtc":"2026-10-31T12:00:00Z","altText":"","attribute_AccountCode":"WatchWord Glasses","attribute_Genre":"Film","attribute_Location":"Cinema","attribute_ParentAndBabyScreening":false,"attribute_PresentationType":"Miscellaneous","attribute_PriorityBooking":"No","attribute_PriorityBookingDays":"0","attribute_SubGenre":"-","attribute_Venue":"Old Market Hall","attribute_WebsiteLocation":"Old Market Hall","attribute_WebsiteSelection":false,"attribute_EventInfo1":"","attribute_EventInfo2":"","attribute_TicketLine1":"","attribute_PRSClassification":"","attribute_EventInfo3":"","attribute_OMHFilmCategories":""},{"description":"","htmlDescription":"<div id>\r\n\r\n</div>","duration":0,"imageUrl":"","isOnSale":true,"name":"WEARING CHERYL BAKER","instanceDates":"5 February-5 February","thumbnailUrl":"","webUrl":"","webEventId":null,"id":"867508ARSLNQTBDMNHQCJVQLTGLDHVHHT","firstInstanceDateTime":"2027-02-05T19:30:00","firstInstanceDateTimeUtc":"2027-02-05T19:30:00Z","lastInstanceDateTime":"2027-02-05T19:30:00","lastInstanceDateTimeUtc":"2027-02-05T19:30:00Z","altText":"","attribute_AccountCode":"A93083/11026 Theatre 26/27","attribute_Genre":